Z||000000||JSocha||08-15-2001||03:36 PM||||Standard,<P>Just wondering how your trip went to Minot.<P>No cops I hope as I noticed they were out in full force this past weekend.<P>What route did you take?<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Standard||08-15-2001||11:34 PM||||Went pretty good!  Did take hwy 2 on the way up, but didn't notice we were in rugby till we got halfway through the town.  Brain was a little numb from all the driving..  Managed about 75-80mph the whole way there, made it in around 8 hours.  <P>Went down on 83 through bismarck on the way back, thinking it would be faster because we could skip all the construction on 2.  Took about the same amount of time.. saw lots of troopers out.<P>Minot was cool, nice little town.  Didn't see a single Fiero though..<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_pic_full.jpg">        <BR>1988 Quad 4 Coupe 5 speed<P><FONT SIZE="1">1986 GT 5 speed, 1984 SC Auto<BR><FONT COLOR="red">AOL: LastMinuteBastrd  AIM: SavedbyJebus</FONT></FONT>||||reg||1
